    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tele makwo kodi ji m'oyer",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo, weyi win miyo jowoti win litho, kodi twodo je, kosa rendirok, kosa nyeko, kosa nyeko nyingi wadi win! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bedi win paka nyithindho maŋic ma nyaka onywol jo, ma wiwinjo riyo ma cak m'olony ma cuny, aka ka wimadho wibino dongo i both mewin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.34.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 34:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole ndiko waco ni, “Witieko bilo bero pa Rwoth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biye win bongi Rwoth, tele makwo ma ji jokwero nike bukony, to Were oyero paka dikony rigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato wibende wibedo telin makwo, m'onyo igero gine Ot pa Were ma cuny, kama wibino tiy'iye paka jocway ri Were i wi migam ma joleŋ, kareno wicwayo cowirok manyacuny ma Were jolo luwo kwoŋ Yesu Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.28.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 28:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato ndiko waco ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
