              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.43.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 43:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.9.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 9:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To wibedo ji m'oyer, jocway ri Kere wi migam, nono maleŋ, ji pa Were won, ŋey winyal pako tim pa Were ma urere, go m'olwoŋo win wok i mudho donjo i lero pere maŋon ma kiwacere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.2.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 2:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo m'okadho oyido wikibedo ji m'oyer, to pama onyo wibedo ji pa Were; i hongo m'okadho oyido wikijolo wor pa Were, to pama onyo wijolo wor pere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jotic pa Were",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agoyo koko riwin jowotan, paka jowiloka i piny me, ni ŋuti win kwoŋ awanya mareco, ma ndir je lwenyo gi cuny win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula mewin i dier joma bu Were wobedi maber ma ka jotemi kelo kwoŋ win wac ni wireco, jobino neno tim mewin mabeyo, to jopako Were i Ndelo ma bino pere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "R'atoŋa pa Rwoth, winji win jodhum je ma piny; kad'obedo kere madwoŋ ma dhumo joman je, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kosa gavana, ma go oro ma miyo jotimi reco gir'acula, gi foyo joma timo gima beyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Were yenyo ni tim mewin mabeyo woum luwo masisiri mapa jomamiŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwo mewin wobedi paka apa joma ni siem; to wikiri wiloki siem mewin ma umo reco moro je; kucel kwo mewin wobedi paka apa jotic pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wor win ji je: Mar win jowoti win ma joyeyo, lwor win Were, aka wiwor kere ma piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ranen ma candirok pa Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋecin, winji win rwodhe mewin, aka nyuthi win jo wor m'opoŋ, ki nyaka joma timo riwin maber aka joparo kwoŋ win kende, to kiri joma ger bende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole nitie kony moro ka dhano ociro litho ma candirok rupiri dwoko paro pere kwoŋ Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To bero aŋo ma wilimo ka wiciro goco ma ripo kodi win ka witimo reco? Kucel ka wiciro candirok kada witieko timo bero, meno ama Were miyo silwany. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were olwoŋo win ri gime, rupiri Kristo bende ocandere riwin aka oweyo riwin ranen, nike winyal luwo bathe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.53.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 53:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiko waco ni, “Go k'otimo gimarac moro, aka ongoye twodo m'owok i dhoke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.53.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 53:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo oyeti go, k'oculo kwor; munyo ocandere, go k'opiro nyatoro, t'oketho geno pere i Were ma Jathum banja i tiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
